Package: @{package}
Version: @{version}
Architecture: @{arch}
Maintainer: MachineFabric <support@machinefabric.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Homepage: https://capdag.com
Description: @{package} — machine-notation and single-cap executor CLI
